</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Principalities and powers,</l><l>Mustering their unseen array,</l><l>Wait for thy unguarded hours:</l><l>Watch and pray.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Gird thy heavenly armor on,</l><l>Wear it ever night and day;</l><l>Ambushed lies the evil one:</l><l>Watch and pray.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Hear the victors who o’ercame,</l><l>Still they mark each warrior’s way;</l><l>All with one sweet voice exclaim,</l><l>Watch and pray.</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>Hear, above all, hear thy Lord,</l><l>Him thou lovest to obey;</l><l>Hide within thy heart His word:</l><l>Watch and pray.</l></lg>
<lg label="6."><l>Watch, as if on that alone</l><l>Hung the issue of the day;</l><l>Pray, that help may be sent down:</l><l>Watch and pray.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
